## 架构小结

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  subgraph html [index.html]
    attachChip["#attachChip (above textarea)"]
    toolbar[".aioq-composer-toolbar"]
    plusMenu["+ → 上传文件 / 引用笔记"]
    status["#composerContextStatus (counts only)"]
  end

  subgraph js [user-chat-portal.js]
    ctx["composerContext"]
    render["renderAttachChip + renderComposerContext"]
    select["selectAgent / restoreSession / btnNewChat"]
  end

  plusMenu --> ctx
  ctx --> render --> attachChip
  ctx --> status
  select -->|"clearChat only"| chatMsgs
  select -.->|"does NOT reset"| ctx
```

如需实现「切换 agent/会话时清空附件」，需要在 `selectAgent()`、`restoreSession()` 和/或 `btnNewChat` handler 中显式重置 `composerContext.attachments`（以及按需重置 `noteIds`）并调用 `renderComposerContext()`——当前代码库中**不存在**这类逻辑。

